// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Super Jump 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3752711311" "Super Jump"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P741067350" "Toggle: Self Long Jump"
// Power Help Text :
"P2742943184" "While this power is active, you can leap great distances and heights, easily jumping over buildings and from rooftop to rooftop!  If you attack a target while this power is on, you will temporarily be reduced to a normal jump height. You must be at least level 14 and have Jump Kick or Combat Jumping before selecting Super Jump."

