// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Event_Speed 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3471299058" "Speed"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flurry 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P189132002" "Flurry"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2562606845" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P2651604573" "Unleashes a super fast Flurry of punches to pummel your foe. Flurry is so dizzying that it has a chance to Disorient the target."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1516596182" "You pummel {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hasten 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1852402460" "Hasten"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1776881406" "Self +Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P2481484113" "You can reduce the recharge time of all powers for 2 minutes. Although Hasten does not cost any Endurance to activate, you can tire easily since your Endurance does not recover more rapidly. After Hasten wears off, you become tired and will lose some Endurance."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3207966633" "Your {PowerName} has increased your rate of attack."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Super Speed 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2257439684" "Super Speed"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P295778697" "Toggle: Self +Speed"
// Power Help Text :
"P424403013" "You can run at super-human speeds! While running at such speeds, you are a blur, and many foes will not even notice you as you speed past them. If you attack a target while this power is on, you will temporarily be slowed to normal speed. You must be at least level 14 and have Flurry or Hasten before selecting Super Speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Whirlwind 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4152178509" "Whirlwind"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3487441435" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1867636671" "You spin around at an amazing speed to create a Whirlwind around yourself. Any foes that enter this Whirlwind will be tossed into the air. You must be at least level 20 and have two other Speed Powers before selecting Whirlwind."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3144030591" "You spin into a {PowerName}, and can now toss your foes in the air like the garbage they are."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Event_Teleportation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1190958607" "Teleportation"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Recall Friend 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P812562171" "Recall Friend"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2036146223" "Zone-Range: Teleport Teammate"
// Power Help Text :
"P2023692947" "You can Teleport one of your teammates to yourself. The target must be a teammate and can be selected from the Team Window. You can also rescue a fallen teammate who may be in a hostile location, as long as he is on the same map. Range is not infinite, but extremely long and can be enhanced. This power can be interrupted."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1238835661" "You Recall  {PlayerDest} close to you"
// DisplayConfirm :
"P544012402" "{PlayerSource} would like to Teleport you.  Do you Accept?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Teleport Foe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P680150745" "Teleport Foe"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2368757613" "Ranged, Teleport Foe"
// Power Help Text :
"P1121670980" "You can Teleport a single foe directly next to yourself. A successful hit must be made in order to Teleport the target, and some powerful foes cannot be Teleported. This power can be interrupted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Teleport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P569504987" "Teleport"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2537599147" "Ranged (Location), Self Teleport"
// Power Help Text :
"P14200970" "You can Teleport long distances. Teleport has no recharge time, and can be reactivated without pause, as long as you have Endurance. You must be at least level 14 and have Recall Friend or Teleport Foe before selecting Teleport."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Team Teleport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P98004820" "Team Teleport"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3645308931" "Ranged (Location), Team Teleport"
// Power Help Text :
"P2363480211" "You can Teleport yourself and your nearby teammates to a targeted location. Teammates must be in close proximity to you. Team Teleport costs slightly more Endurance than Teleport, but you can Teleport your entire team for no additional cost. You must be at least level 20 and have two other Teleportation Powers before selecting Team Teleport."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4018568147" "You Teleport your Team."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2686822699" "{PlayerSource} has Teleported you."

