"P4280515429" "Unstoppable"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2832362132" "Self, +Res(Disorient, Sleep, Hold, Immobilize, All DMG but Psionics)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1545815299" "When you activate this power, you not only become extremely resistant to most damage, but also to Disorient, Immobilization, Hold, and Sleep effects. Endurance recovery is also increased. Unstoppable costs little Endurance to activate, but when it wears off you are left exhausted, and drained of almost all Health and Endurance. Recharge: Very Long"
