// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1501284489" "Your {PowerName} electrocutes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chain Fences 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3661323479" "Chain Fences"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4254061040" "Ranged AoE, Minor DMG(Energy), Foe Immobilize, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2945880608" "You can immobilize multiple foes in a chain of electricity, dealing minor damage to all foes in range and draining some endurance.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2815959647" "Immobilize, -End"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2874829254" "You are immobilized by the Chain Fences."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
