// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Entangle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2311510427" "Entangle"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1977928016" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Smashing, Lethal), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P758686855" "Immobilizes your target by Entangling their feet in a twisted mass of thorny roots.  The roots do smashing and lethal damage to the target over time. More resilient foes may require multiple applications to Immobilize. Entangle can immobilize flying targets, if they are near the ground when attacked. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1307118483" "The roots have Entangled you, crushing and cutting you. You are immobile and cannot fly."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3255310503" "{PlayerSource} Entangles you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P853782236" "Thorns from the roots cut you for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Strangler 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3361538192" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Smashing), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2121824688" "Holds a distant foe by Strangling him with massive root-like vines. The target is held helpless, while he is slowly crushed by the vines. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1388205829" "Hold, DoT(Smashing)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1317566367" "The Strangler Vine is crushing you and preventing you from acting."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2383523282" "{PlayerSource} crushes you with Strangler Vines for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Roots 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3338619209" "Immobilizes a group of foes by entangling their feet in a twisted mass of thorny Roots.  Roots is slower and does less damage than Entangle, but it can capture multiple foes in one attack. Like Entangle, Roots can immobilize flying targets, if they are near the ground when attacked. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3511610119" "{PlayerSource} Roots you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spore Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3125035697" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P1869576980" "You hurl a large fungi pod at your foes.  This pod is full of Spores that burst on impact, engulfing the target and all those around him.  All affected targets may succumb to the narcotic effect of the Spores and will fall asleep. The targets will remain asleep for some time, but will awaken if attacked. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P916330070" "{PlayerSource} poisons you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Seeds of Confusion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P822704386" "Seeds of Confusion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P233247000" "Ranged (Cone), Foe Confuse"
// Power Help Text :
"P2412309615" "You throw a handful of seeds from a rare Baffle plant at your foes.  The seeds spread out in a wide cone and release a dusty chaff that contain a number of alkaloids and hallucinogenic compounds.  Foes that come into contact with these seeds become violently confused and will turn and attack each other, ignoring you and all your allies. You will not receive any Experience Points for foes defeated entirely by Confused enemies. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1116895679" "Confuse"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4213198885" "You are confused and may attack an incorrect target."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Vines 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2760912049" "Vines"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3095732666" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P267223508" "Creates a field of Strangler Vines that can Hold multiple foes at range. The affected targets are held helpless by the massive root-like vines. Unlike the power Strangler, this power does not deal any damage, but it can Hold multiple foes at once. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1778180013" "The Vines are Holding you and preventing you from acting."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2239587838" "The vines cut you for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Carrion Creepers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3728825099" "Carrion Creepers"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1677778155" "Summon Creepers, Ranged (Location AoE), Target -Speed, -Fly, -Jump,"
// Power Help Text :
"P2565561919" "You can create a Creeper patch at a targeted location.  The patch will snag foes, slowing their movement, and preventing them from jumping or flying. Additionally, a Creeper Vine will burst from under each live and defeated foe in the area and start attacking your enemies. Creeper Vines do minimal damage, but they can knock down your enemies and its poisonous thorns can slow your foes. Any foes that are defeated in the Creeper patch will also produce a growth of Entangle Roots that will Immobilize any enemies near the defeated foe. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fly Trap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P349392526" "Fly Trap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3041632272" "Summon Fly Trap: Ranged Control Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P785516111" "You can summon a giant carnivorous Fly Trap plant beast.  Fly Trap may be an understatement, as this plant beast has a taste for flesh.  The Fly Trap will viciously attack any nearby foes; biting, hurling poisonous Thorns and even casting its own Entangle Roots. The Fly Trap will fight by your side and can be healed and buffed like any teammate. Recharge: Very Long"

