"P1078224859" "Manticore"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fistful of Arrows 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P34818005" "Fistful of Arrows"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1992527543" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1881225209" "You fire a fistful of arrows at foes in a cone in front of you. Good at close range. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2180169402" "{PlayerSource} blasts your with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blazing Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P738515790" "Blazing Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2270848042" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Lethal), Moderate DoT(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1544236306" "You fire a Blazing Arrow at your foe, dealing some Lethal damage and causing him to catch on fire and burn. Slightly less accurate than other Archery attacks. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P339710705" "You are on fire!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Explosive Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P628004273" "Explosive Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3488546260" "You fire a grenade-tipped arrow at long range. This explosion affects all within the blast radius, and can knock them back. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3097641125" "{PlayerSource} hits you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2913870661" "{PlayerSource} hits you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stunning Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2733527973" "Stunning Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3171103798" "Ranged Disorient, Minor DMG(Smashing)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3865578818" "You fire a blunt, weighted arrow at your target's chest. The Stunning Shot has a good chance of stunning your foe. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Rain of Arrows 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P176489045" "Rain of Arrows"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4007919099" "Ranged (Location AoE), Extreme DoT(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3986580263" "You unleash a Rain of Arrows on a targeted location, damaging foes within a large area. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Entangling Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3890749173" "Entangling Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1642214998" "Ranged, Target Immobilize, -Recharge, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P729860196" "Upon impact, the Entangling Arrow releases a strong net that can Immobilize most targets. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking, although their attack rate is Slowed. The Entangling Arrow can bring down flying entities and halts jumping. Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3505771407" "Immobilize, -Fly, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1437345835" "You have been caught in a net. You cannot move or fly and your attack speed is reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3416938233" "Ice Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3570542779" "Ranged, Foe Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3906379218" "This arrow can freeze a single foe in a block of ice. The target is frozen solid, helpless, and can be attacked. More powerful foes may not be Held, but all affected targets will be Slowed. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2267104667" "Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1196691141" "You are frozen in a Block of Ice.  Once free, your Attack Rate and Running speed will be reduced slightly for a while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Poison Gas Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2744262583" "Poison Gas Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2929584923" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P128246789" "This arrow carries a capsule cloud of poisonous gas, which explodes on impact and weakens all foes in its vicinity. Affected foes damage potential will be severely reduced. Some foes will react badly to the poison and choke for a time.  Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Acid Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2671335934" "Acid Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1037696611" "Ranged AoE Minor DoT(Toxic), Foe -Res(All), -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1804268649" "This arrow explodes in a small shower of acid on impact. This acid eats through armor, causing damage over time. It reduces the target's Defense as well as his Damage Resistance.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3256323102" "Your {PowerName} splashes acid on {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P472308012" "{PlayerSource} hits you with an Acid Arrow.  The acid is burning you and reducing your damage resistance."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2396833550" "-Res(All), -DEF, Minor DoT(Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1207406105" "Your Resistances and Defense have been weakened by the Acid Arrow."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2022712491" "Your {PowerName} continues to burn {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4225091485" "You continue to burn from the {PowerName} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : EMP Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P993615740" "EMP Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1500918562" "AoE, Foe Hold, Special vs. Robots, Self -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P2063198606" "This arrow can unleash a massive pulse of electromagnetic energy on impact. This EMP can affect machines, and is even powerful enough to affect synaptic brain patterns. It will incapacitate all foes in its radius. Additionally, most machines and robots will take moderate high damage. However, this power uses a lot of Endurance and leaves you unable to recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3549109959" "You are held immobile by the EMP Pulse and your Regeneration Rate is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2753580196" "Your {PowerName} Disorients and Immobilizes {PlayerDest}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4082949565" "{PlayerSource} blasts you for {Damage} points of energy damage with his {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Teleport Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2879575510" "Teleport Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1851910702" "Ranged, High DMG(Lethal), Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P854271660" "Manticore has the ability to teleport an arrow directly to his target."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2616620366" "Though it takes longer to execute, your Aimed Shot deals greater damage than the Talon Snap Shot. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"

